Flash inspection
----------------
src/flash.js adapts flash-table decoding and region names from src/formats.rs
and src/sectormap.rs in
https://github.com/jvitkauskas/m-flasher at commit
67858a6530861a8bad64a29e38c4e33392e4f6e5, Copyright (c) 2026 Julius Vitkauskas,
MIT. Its licence is retained in vendor/flash-formats/LICENSE. No native USB
transport or flash-loader binary from that project is included.

No firmware is included. A .fwsc file chosen on the page is read in the browser and sent only to
the FM-1 over USB.

